    "name": "minimal-edited.yaml",
    "text": "# netatlas test fixture: examples/minimal.yaml after being imported and edited\n# (generated by scripts/make-fixtures.mjs): loopbacks with IPv4 + IPv6,\n# r1 renamed to edge-1 (references updated), cable attributes and an iBGP\n# session between the loopbacks. Original comments are preserved.\n# netatlas example: the smallest useful file.\n# Two routers, one cable, one GRE tunnel with an OSPF adjacency inside it.\nnetatlas: 1\ntitle: Minimal example (edited in netatlas)\n\ndevices:\n  - id: edge-1\n    type: router\n    router_id: lo0\n    protocols:\n      bgp: {asn: 65001}\n      ospf: {}\n    interfaces:\n      - {id: eth0, ip: 192.0.2.1/30}\n    logical_interfaces:\n      - {id: tun0, type: tunnel, source: eth0, destination: r2:eth0}\n      - {id: lo0, type: loopback, label: Router ID, ip: [10.255.0.1/32, 2001:db8:ffff::1/128]}\n  - id: r2\n    type: router\n    router_id: lo0\n    protocols:\n      bgp: {asn: 65001}\n      ospf: {}\n    interfaces:\n      - {id: eth0, ip: 192.0.2.2/30}\n    logical_interfaces:\n      - {id: tun0, type: tunnel, source: eth0, destination: edge-1:eth0}\n      - {id: lo0, type: loopback, label: Router ID, ip: [10.255.0.2/32, 2001:db8:ffff::2/128]}\n\nlinks:\n  - id: cable-1\n    a: edge-1:eth0\n    b: r2:eth0\n    medium: copper\n    speed: 1G\n    attrs:\n      patch-panel: PP-3 port 14\n      length: 2m\n\nrelations:\n  - id: gre-1\n    protocol: gre\n    endpoints: [edge-1:tun0, r2:tun0]\n    over: cable-1\n  - id: ospf-1\n    protocol: ospf\n    endpoints: [edge-1:tun0, r2:tun0]\n    over: gre-1\n  - id: bgp-1\n    protocol: ibgp\n    endpoints: [edge-1:lo0, r2:lo0]\n    over: ospf-1\n    attrs:\n      update-source: lo0\n\nlayout:\n  physical:\n    edge-1: [75, 65]\n    r2: [336, 65]\n  logical:\n    edge-1: [75, 114]\n    r2: [602, 114]\n"
